<title>USA: General Magic says CFO Zimmerman resigns.</title>
<headline>General Magic says CFO Zimmerman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Magic Inc said Thursday that John Zimmerman had resigned as senior vice president-finance and administration and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>President, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Steve Markman will assume the duties of chief financial officer, General Magic said.</p>
</text>
